        <mxCell id="package_rules" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;" value="&lt;b&gt;Package rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;common/ contains only enums and immutable value objects; zero imports from other packages; frozen after Day 1.&lt;br&gt;Dependencies are one-way (no cycles): common is used by agents, facilities, missions, emergencies, environment, resources, colony. agents is used by missions, emergencies, colony. facilities is used by resources, missions, emergencies, colony. missions is used by emergencies (RoverBreakdown only). colony is used by Main. No arrows point back up; no package imports anything above it." vertex="1">
